OL,3,AFour arrested after police officer
OL,4,Ainjured in shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo women, 27 and 25, and a 24-year-old
OL,7,Fman were arrested after police stopped
OL,8,Fa vehicle in the Radford area of
OL,9,FNottingham on Sunday evening, while a
OL,10,F30-year-old man was arrested in
OL,11,FBedfordshire in the early hours of
OL,12,FMonday.
